\**Note**: You'll need to step on pads that require a certain weight. You'll either need 1 {p:Galka}, 3 {p:Tarutaru} or any combination of 2 of {p:Hume}/{p:Elvaan}/{p:Mithra}.
* (Optional: Go to {z:Eastern Altepa Desert}, and complete the quest {q:Open Sesame|Open Sesame|Open Sesame} for the {@k} {k:Loadstone} key item, allowing you to pass through the doors alone).
** If you have it already unlocked, you can use the {z:Quicksand Caves} {p:Home Point} #1 to get quick access to {z:Chamber of Oracles}.
*** The {p:Proto-Waypoint}: Quicksand Caves is also a quick way to get the the Chamber, just drop down and follow the path, keeping west.
* If other people in your party are progressing with you: ensure everyone is on the mission {M:Through the Quicksand Caves|Through the Quicksand Caves|Through the Quicksand Caves}.
** If not, they have not properly completed the previous mission, check key items to see which is missing.
* If you're low level and not using {p:Trusts}, you'll want a party of level 65+. You will be entering a BCNM fight against 3 {p:Antica|Category:Antica} NMs, who all have a TP attack that will {p:Silence} (Jamming Wave), mages should all bring {@i:Echo Drops|4151} {i:Echo Drops|Echo Drops|4151}.

=2 Walkthrough
!Western Altepa Desert.jpg|right|Western Altepa Desert
!Quicksand Caves-map5.jpg|right|Quicksand Caves Map 5
* Everything here is aggressive to {@a:Sound|Detects by Sound} sound, so make sure everyone has {s:Sneak}.
** Using the {p:Unity Warp} 125 will locate you in Western Altepa Desert (I-7).
* Proceed to {z:Western Altepa Desert} and head for the tunnel at (C/D-11) south side.
** Following this tunnel will bring you to an unmarked area of the desert.
* Head down the ramp to (D-12) and enter {z:Quicksand Caves}.
* Go to (I-9) and step on the weight pad and go through the door.
** If the KI {@k} {k:Loadstone} was acquired, you still need to step on the weight pads.
* Go west to (H-7) and use another weight pad to pass through a door.
* In the next room, drop down the hole to a hidden area.
* Head to (D-4) to zone in to the {z:Chamber of Oracles}.

=2 Boss Fight
* Get ready and enter the BCNM. You'll be facing 3 Antica NMs
** A dual boxed 75 BLM, 75 WHM and 75 THF/NIN can easily beat this BCNM. THF only took damage from occasional RNG attacks, and Magnetic cloud.
** You can use {p:Trusts} in this fight.
* Upon clearing the BC, you'll zone in to another area of the Chamber of Oracles, which starts the next mission.

[Area
{z:Chamber of Oracles |Chamber of Oracles}
